ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi007: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a PLANE (z=0, normal +Z); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP with four ORIENTED_EDGEs listed in non-traversal slot order (0→1, 2→3, 3→0, 1→2 of unit square); head/tail vertices of consecutive emitted edges do not match; edges as a set can be reordered into one valid head-to-tail circuit; disordered EDGE_LOOP IS the mechanism; kernel must reorder by vertex matching to recover head-to-tail traversal; if no consistent ordering exists reject as malformed */
